===Etymology===
{{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|sceptre|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|sceptrum|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|σκῆπτρον||staff, stick, baton|lang=grc}}, from {{term|σκήπτω||to prop, to support, to lean upon a staff|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[ornamental]] [[staff]] held by a [[ruling]] [[monarch]] as a [[symbol]] of [[power]].

====Derived terms====
